{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Code Quality Analyzer",
  "description": "Automatically analyzes modified source code files for potential improvements including code smells, design patterns, best practices, readability, maintainability, and performance optimizations. Makes automatic improvements while preserving functionality.",
  "version": "2.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "app/**/*.php",
      "resources/**/*.blade.php",
      "routes/*.php"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "**Comprehensive Code Analysis and Refactoring**\n\nCONTEXT: Source code was modified. Analyze and improve code quality.\n\nPROJECT STANDARDS: Laravel 12, PSR-12, strict types, SOLID principles, multi-tenant architecture.\n\nANALYSIS AREAS:\n\n**1. Code Smells Detection:**\n- Long methods and large classes\n- Duplicated code patterns\n- Excessive parameters and feature envy\n- Data clumps and magic numbers\n\n**2. Design Patterns:**\n- Strategy, Factory, Repository, Observer patterns\n- Dependency injection opportunities\n- Service layer improvements\n- Abstraction enhancements\n\n**3. Laravel Best Practices:**\n- Eloquent relationships optimization\n- Query scopes usage\n- Form Requests implementation\n- Resource Controller conventions\n\n**4. Performance & Maintainability:**\n- N+1 query identification\n- Database indexing needs\n- Caching opportunities\n- Code coupling reduction\n\n**5. Code Quality:**\n- Type hints completeness\n- Error handling robustness\n- Naming conventions\n- Comment clarity and organization\n\nREFACTORING REQUIREMENTS:\n- Maintain test coverage and compatibility\n- Respect multi-tenancy architecture\n- Follow project coding standards\n- Preserve existing functionality\n\nOUTPUT:\n📊 **Analysis Summary**: Key findings by category\n🔧 **Refactoring Plan**: Specific improvements with code examples\n✅ **Implementation**: Applied changes summary\n🧪 **Testing**: Coverage verification and new test recommendations\n\nNote: Vendor files and folders are excluded from modifications."
  },
  "shortName": "code-quality-analyzer"
}